Package: bmrr
Title: Run a Bayesina Multivaraite Rank Regression Model 
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Rose", "Graves", , "rosekgraves@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A model for analyzing and aggregating multivaraite rank data. Using latent
  hierarchical regression models, bmrr pools information across raters and criteria, 
  incorporates covariates and rater expertise, and constructs an aggregate
  ranking. bmrr provides full posterior uncertainty quantification for
  this aggregate ranking and all model parameters, and readily handles partial rankings 
  and ties. The package includes a data sample mechanism and example sports data.
